{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20246","headline":"哭刘言史 · 孟郊","name":"哭刘言史","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诗人业孤峭，饿死良已多。\n相悲与相笑，累累其奈何。\n精异刘言史，诗肠倾珠河。\n取次抱置之，飞过东溟波。\n可惜大国谣，飘爲四夷歌。\n常於衆中会，颜色两切[磋]。\n今日果成死，葬襄之洛河。\n洛岸远相吊，洒泪双滂沱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20246.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20246","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}